#===========================================================================================

- title: Magic Mismatch (file drop)
  description: A file was dropped, where the file extension does not match
    the magic bytes. Indicates that file extension is fake, which is suspicious.
  score: 20
  category: ["evasion", "file", "file drop", "initial vector", "loader"]
  components:
  - type: file
    action: create
    conditions:
      magic_mismatch: true
      has_scary_magic: true

